  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu:p001:m0000" ref="w4m_9tw_147_A">東昏</persName><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu:p001:m0002" ref="6fs_tis_zoa_AA">褚皇后</persName>名<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu:p001:m0006" ref="6fs_tis_zoa_AA">令璩</persName>，河南陽翟人，太常<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu:p001:m0017" ref="6fs_tis_zoa_A">澄</persName>女也。建武二年，納為皇太子妃。明年，謁<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu:p001:m0037" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6_A">敬后</persName>廟。東昏即位，為皇后。帝寵<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu:p001:m0052" ref="gp4_61p_jwc">潘妃</persName>，后不被遇。<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu:p001:m0060" ref="nxr_ok6_sn7">黃淑儀</persName>生太子<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-chulingqu:p001:m0066" ref="w4m_9tw_147_AA">誦</persName>，東昏廢，竝為庶人。</p>
</text>
